  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into small chunks. Cut capsicum into large chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64632b6c4c69436021079cf7/step-44827a65.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut lime into wedges. Drain and rinse red kidney beans. Trim green beans.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook garlic paste and mild Caribbean jerk seasoning, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, coconut milk and vegetable stock powder, stirring to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64632b6c4c69436021079cf7/step-2c75da16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add kidney beans and green beans to the soup. Bring to a simmer and cook until slightly thickened, 6-10 minutes.\n• Stir though roasted veggies. Season to taste.\n• Add a squeeze of lime juice to taste. TIP: Stir through a splash of water if the soup is too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64632b6c4c69436021079cf7/step-6a5bf677.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Caribbean bean and capsicum coconut soup between bowls.\n• Serve with any remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64632b6c4c69436021079cf7/step-5716c317.jpg"
    }
  ]
